      "slide_number": 14,
      "slide_id": "cc-s10c-no-card-yet",
      "description": "Screen 10C — No Card Yet Route",
      "html": "<style>\n@keyframes drift { 0% { opacity:0; transform:translateY(14px);} 100% { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0);} }\n.j1 { animation: drift .5s ease .1s both; }\n.j2 { animation: drift .5s ease .4s both; }\n.j3 { animation: drift .5s ease .7s both; }\n</style>\n<div style=\"width:100%; flex:1; display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:20px; text-align:center; background:var(--surface-2, #FFFFFF); color:var(--text-primary, #171717); padding:28px 24px; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:48px; margin-bottom:4px;\">👛</div>\n  <p class=\"j1\" style=\"font-size:20px; font-weight:700; margin:0; line-height:1.4; color:var(--text-primary, #171717);\">\n    No card yet, no problem.\n  </p>\n  <p class=\"j1\" style=\"font-size:14.5px; color:var(--text-secondary, #5F5E5A); margin:-10px 0 0;\">\n    What's your monthly income right now?\n  </p>\n\n  <div class=\"j2\" style=\"border:2px solid var(--text-accent, #0C447C); border-radius:14px; padding:12px 20px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; background:#FFFFFF; width:100%; max-width:240px; justify-content:center;\">\n    <span style=\"font-size:24px; color:var(--text-muted, #888780); font-weight:700;\">₹</span>\n    <input type=\"number\" value=\"15000\" style=\"font-size:26px; font-weight:700; font-family:Georgia,serif; border:none; outline:none; background:transparent; width:120px; text-align:center; color:var(--text-primary, #171717);\" />\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"j3\" style=\"font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-muted, #888780); margin:0;\">\n    Pocket money, salary, freelance — just the total.\n  </p>\n\n  <button class=\"j3 cta\" style=\"width:100%; max-width:280px; height:54px; border-radius:14px; background:var(--text-primary, #171717); color:#FFFFFF; border:none; font-size:15px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; margin-top:8px;\">\n    Estimate my first limit →\n  </button>\n</div>"
